OL,3,GNEWSANew vision for 'landmark pub'
OL,4,Asaved by volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRegulars were so upset when
OL,7,FNottingham's Golden Fleece pub closed
OL,8,Fin January 2026, they decided to try to
OL,9,Fsave it.
OL,11,FBut rather than simply reopen the Grade
OL,12,FII-listed building as a pub, they
OL,13,Fdecided to combine it with a
OL,14,Fnot-for-profit community facility
OL,15,Fhosting events such as creative and
OL,16,Fmental health workshops.
OL,18,FThe team behind it said they had no
OL,19,Fbudget, needed donations for materials
OL,20,Fused, and received help from unpaid
OL,21,Fvolunteers.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
