OL,3,GNEWSANew vision for 'landmark pub'
OL,4,Asaved by volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Boyle, one of the leaders of the
OL,7,Fproject which is set to launch in
OL,8,FDecember, said: "It's such a historical
OL,9,Fpub. It's a landmark in Nottingham for
OL,10,Fa lot of people who have great memories
OL,11,Fthere, we want to bring that vibe
OL,12,Fback."
